    - probabilities: dict category -> probability
    - entropy: Shannon entropy (bits)
    - normalized_entropy: entropy / log2(k), in [0,1]
    - gini: Gini coefficient in [0,1] (0 = perfectly uniform, 1 = total concentration)
    - js_divergence: Jensen-Shannon divergence to uniform (bits)
    - chi2_stat: chi-squared statistic (against uniform)
    - chi2_pvalue: p-value (None if not computable)
    - is_uniform: boolean (True if chi2 p-value > significance, else False; if p-value None, fallback to normalized_entropy)
    - description: human-readable introduction and interpretation
